    {
      "id": "algebra_grade8_foundation_008",
      "topic": "algebra",
      "subtopic": "quartic_solution_count",
      "difficulty": "foundation",
      "levelStage": "grade8",
      "challengeTier": "foundation",
      "prompt": {
        "zh-Hant": "有多少個不同的實數 x 滿足 (x^2 - 5)^2 = 16？",
        "zh-Hans": "有多少个不同的实数 x 满足 (x^2 - 5)^2 = 16？",
        "en": "How many distinct real numbers x satisfy (x^2 - 5)^2 = 16?",
        "ja": "方程式 (x^2 - 5)^2 = 16 を満たす異なる実数 x は何個ありますか。"
      },
      "answer": {
        "zh-Hant": "答案是 4 個。",
        "zh-Hans": "答案是 4 个。",
        "en": "The answer is 4.",
        "ja": "答えは 4 個です。"
      },
      "solutionSteps": {
        "zh-Hant": [
          "由 (x^2 - 5)^2 = 16，可得 x^2 - 5 = 4 或 x^2 - 5 = -4。",
          "第一種情況得到 x^2 = 9，所以 x = 3 或 -3。",
          "第二種情況得到 x^2 = 1，所以 x = 1 或 -1。",
          "因此共有 4 個不同的實數解。"
        ],
        "zh-Hans": [
          "由 (x^2 - 5)^2 = 16，可得 x^2 - 5 = 4 或 x^2 - 5 = -4。",
          "第一种情况得到 x^2 = 9，所以 x = 3 或 -3。",
          "第二种情况得到 x^2 = 1，所以 x = 1 或 -1。",
          "因此共有 4 个不同的实数解。"
        ],
        "en": [
          "From (x^2 - 5)^2 = 16, we get x^2 - 5 = 4 or x^2 - 5 = -4.",
          "The first case gives x^2 = 9, so x = 3 or -3.",
          "The second gives x^2 = 1, so x = 1 or -1.",
          "Therefore there are 4 distinct real solutions."
        ],
        "ja": [
          "(x^2 - 5)^2 = 16 から x^2 - 5 = 4 または x^2 - 5 = -4。",
